  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「うひゃひゃひゃ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「良ぇで～、良ぇ感じやで～！　ここまでは、計画どおりっ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「かつてウチの悪巧みが、これほど『とんとん拍子』に進んだことがあったやろうか？　いや、ない！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「今日のウチは運命の神さんに愛されてんで～っ、うひゃひゃ☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ゆうても。ちと『岩戸サン』と『小松ぼたん』の差が開きすぎやな、これやと『競争』にならへんわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ちぃと、テコ入れが必要やなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「『宝探し』じたいは一本道を進んで『宝箱』をゲットしていくだけ～、っていう単調なもんやねんから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ふたりの『競争』が、見どころやねんけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「このままやと、あっさり『岩戸サン』の勝ちで決着してまうなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「『番人』どもも好意で手伝ってくれてるだけやし、あんまり無茶な妨害もさせられへんしなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ウチが、何とかするしかないやろ。幸い、こんなこともあろうかと色々と準備しとったんよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「うひゃひゃ、ウチの抜け目のなさは天井知らずやで～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ん～。『小松ぼたん』はこっちの思惑を看破して、やる気なくしとんのやろか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「あの『犯行声明』、グダグダやったからなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「エンターテイメントとして、しょっぱいわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「当初の見立てでは、ふたりの戦力は五分五分……ってところやったのになぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「正直、ここまで大差がつくとは思わへんかったわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「もっと鎬を削ってバチバチにやりあってくれんと、つまらんわぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「べつに競馬とちゃうし、賭けもしてへんのやから予定調和でもえぇねんけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「さいあく、今回の依頼主……『あのひと』に話がちがうって怒られてまうわ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「そしたら『報酬』も支払われへんかもなぁ、それは避けたいところやわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ってことで！　先行してる『岩戸サン』を足止めすんでっ、全力で！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ほいで『小松ぼたん』が追いついてくれたら、そっから『競争』も激化するはずやで～っ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「うひゃひゃ☆　園芸部の氷野くるみって子が罠とか仕掛けるのが得意っていうから、手伝ってもろたしな～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ついでに、演劇部の遠見も協力してくれとるんやで！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「同じクラスのよしみ、ってわけでもないやろけど……。珍しく、遠見が積極的で助かったわぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「遠見のやつ、やる気さえだせば『天才児クラス』の連中にもひけをとらへん技術力やからなぁ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「頼みこんで、本格的な罠を製造・設置してもろたで～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「遠見のやつ『地下トンネルは、わたしにとっても憩いの場ですから』とか言っとったなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「どういう意味かわからんけど、おおきにな！　恩に着るで、きょうだいっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「今回は予算も潤沢やからな～、『あのひと』に感謝やわぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「せっかく仕掛けた罠を使わんのも『もったいない』し、どんどん作動させて足止めしたるでっ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「あぁ……何やろ、むっちゃ楽しい！　これやっ、ウチが求めとったのはこの立ち位置やねんよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「ウチは世紀の大悪党っ、柊るなやで～☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 51,
    "dress": "old-vice",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-vice_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 0,
      "y": 452
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "るな",
    "text": "「怪我させん程度に、気をつけて……。どんどん、罠を作動させちゃる！」"
